  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 1dc66e9658df9284f81f0664a7ee2889, type: 3}
  m_Name: EchoFinalCollectible
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::CollectableEntries
  entryTitle: A Note from Echo
  description: 
  neutralDescription: "Chime, I understand that you brought me here to help you,
    I just can\u2019t figure out why. Was it my time? I\u2019ve gone through unexplainable
    things, unable to really help anyone well\u2026was I the right choice? I hope
    you don\u2019t blame me. Something\u2019s happening to me, I hope I don\u2019t
    do anything too crazy\u2026"
  negativeDescription: "Chime. After being pulled in here by you, constantly feeling
    that something\u2019s off, I finally see the truth. I remember now, the tree,
    how much you used to mean to me\u2026all that, just for you to go and use me
    to get your body back. Now, it\u2019s my time to show you my\u2026appreciation."
  positiveDescription: "Chime\u2026I want to say I\u2019m sorry for not having kinder
    words for you when I first came here...for not remembering what happened to you,
    and everything between us. Now that my memories are back, I can\u2019t help but
    feel this\u2026indescribable sorrow. I don\u2019t know what\u2019s about to happen,
    but I\u2019m sorry\u2026"
